# Experiment 4 — allow much more rewriting at the curator step.
#
# SANDBOX ONLY. This suspends the one rule the whole pipeline is built on: that
# a post is stitched from sentences the author actually wrote. Running it
# against the live pool would put model prose on your phone wearing your voice.
#
#   GATE_MODE=report   the gate classifies but never rejects — otherwise a
#                      loose variant is simply wiped out by its own gate and
#                      the experiment measures nothing. It forces GATE_TRACE on.
#   the directive      tells the curator what the extra licence is for.
#
# What comes back is the evidence: every non-verbatim sentence in the provenance
# report carries its nearest source note and a word-level diff, so you can read
# exactly what the model wrote rather than stitched.
GATE_MODE=report
CURATE_DIRECTIVE=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/offline/directives/curate-loose.md
